### ===============================
### TAX & ACCOUNTING
### ===============================

### 52. Initialize Chart of Accounts (Standard Turkish COA)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounting/chart-of-accounts/initialize
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 53. Get All Chart of Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/chart-of-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 54. Get Asset Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/chart-of-accounts?accountType=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 55. Get Liability Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/chart-of-accounts?accountType=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 56. Get Revenue Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/chart-of-accounts?accountType=3
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 57. Create Manual Journal Entry - Cash to Bank Transfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounting/journal-entries
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entryDate": "2025-10-18",
  "description": "Kasa'dan Banka'ya para transferi",
  "lines": [
    {
      "accountId": "{{bankAccountId}}",
      "debitAmount": 10000,
      "creditAmount": 0,
      "description": "Banka'ya transfer"
    },
    {
      "accountId": "{{cashAccountId}}",
      "debitAmount": 0,
      "creditAmount": 10000,
      "description": "Kasa'dan çıkış"
    }
  ]
}

### 58. Create Journal Entry - Opening Capital
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounting/journal-entries
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entryDate": "2025-01-01",
  "description": "Açılış kaydı - İlk sermaye",
  "lines": [
    {
      "accountId": "{{bankAccountId}}",
      "debitAmount": 100000,
      "creditAmount": 0,
      "description": "Banka'ya sermaye girişi"
    },
    {
      "accountId": "{{capitalAccountId}}",
      "debitAmount": 0,
      "creditAmount": 100000,
      "description": "Sermaye"
    }
  ]
}

