### ===============================
### TAX RATE MANAGEMENT (CRUD)
### ===============================

### 62. Get All Tax Rates
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/tax-rates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 63. Get VAT Tax Rates Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/tax-rates?taxType=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 64. Get Active Tax Rates Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/tax-rates?isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 65. Get Tax Rate By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/tax-rates/{{taxRateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 66. Create New VAT Rate (18%)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounting/tax-rates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taxType": 0,
  "name": "KDV %18",
  "code": "KDV18",
  "rate": 18,
  "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01",
  "countryCode": "TR",
  "isDefault": false,
  "description": "2026 yılı için yeni KDV oranı"
}

### 67. Create Withholding Tax Rate
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounting/tax-rates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taxType": 1,
  "name": "Gelir Vergisi Stopajı %25",
  "code": "GVS25",
  "rate": 25,
  "effectiveFrom": "2025-01-01",
  "countryCode": "TR",
  "isDefault": false,
  "description": "Belirli gelirler için %25 stopaj"
}

### 68. Update Tax Rate - Change Rate
PUT {{baseUrl}}/accounting/tax-rates/{{taxRateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{taxRateId}}",
  "rate": 19,
  "description": "Oran %18'den %19'a güncellendi"
}

### 69. Update Tax Rate - Deactivate
PUT {{baseUrl}}/accounting/tax-rates/{{taxRateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{taxRateId}}",
  "isActive": false,
  "description": "Oran pasif yapıldı"
}

### 70. Update Tax Rate - Set as Default
PUT {{baseUrl}}/accounting/tax-rates/{{taxRateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{taxRateId}}",
  "isDefault": true,
  "description": "Varsayılan oran olarak belirlendi"
}

### 71. Delete Tax Rate (Unused)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/accounting/tax-rates/{{taxRateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

